**Exercice 3 (0,75 pt)**

```html
<html><head><title> Santa Djon </title></head>
<body background="desert.jpg">
<p align="center"> <strong>Santa Djon Solidarity </strong></p>
<script language="javascript">
do
{
p=parseInt(prompt("Entrez l'entier p:"));
n=parseInt(prompt("Entrez l'entier n:"));
}
while(n<0 || p<0 || p>n)
o=1;
s=1;
for (i=1;i<=n;i++)
{
o=o*i;
}
for (i=1;i<=p;i++)
{
s=s*i;
}
a=n-p;
m=1;
for (i=1;i<=a;i++)
{
m=m*i;
}
y=s*m;
z=o/y;
alert("La solution :"+z);
</script></body></html>
```
